<<<
One of our most distinguished actresses acquired one of these coastal landmarks [a lighthouse] a good many years ago, & I believe the quietude of the interior provided a much apprectated venue for her dramatic work. Venus. Pl. Venuses, see -s-, -SS-.
===
*One of our most distinguished actresses acquired one of these coastal landmarks* [a lighthouse] *a good many years ago, & I believe the quietude of the interior provided a much appreciated venue for her dramatic work.*

**Venus.** Pl. *Venuses*, see ^^-S-, -SS-^^.
>>>

<<<
For Venus’ & Venus’s, see ’s. veranda(h). OED gives the -da form first, & there is no reason for the -h; the adjective is best written veranda’d, see -ED & °D.
===
For *Venus'* & *Venus's*, see 's.

**veranda(h).** OED gives the *-da* form first, & there is no reason for the -h; the adjective is best written *veranda'd*, see ^^-ED^^ & ^^'D^^.
>>>
